OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785836895
OL,3,CWhite-tailed eagles released in Exmoor
OL,4,Cto boost bird's return to English skies
OL,6,FHalf a dozen young white-tailed eagles
OL,7,Fhave been released in Exmoor National
OL,8,FPark as part of a project to bring the
OL,9,Flost birds back to England's skies.
OL,11,FThe eagles, nicknamed flying barn
OL,12,Fdoors because of their wingspan of up
OL,13,Fto 8ft (2.4m), were once widespread in
OL,14,Fsouthern England until the 18th
OL,15,Fcentury when persecution led to them
OL,16,Fbeing wiped out in the region.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/9
