PN,30602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785836895
OL,3,CWhite-tailed eagles released in Exmoor
OL,4,Cto boost bird's return to English skies
OL,6,FThe six young birds are part of a
OL,7,Fproject by Forestry England and the
OL,8,FRoy Dennis Wildlife Foundation to
OL,9,Frestore the species to England which
OL,10,Fhas seen the release of 45 white-
OL,11,Ftailed eagles from the Isle of Wight
OL,12,Fsince 2019.
OL,14,FSince then, some of the birds have
OL,15,Fstarted breeding and the first wild-
OL,16,Fborn chick in southern England since
OL,17,F1780 was born in 2023.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785836895
OL,3,CWhite-tailed eagles released in Exmoor
OL,4,Cto boost bird's return to English skies
OL,6,FThe six birds released in Exmoor are
OL,7,Fthe first to be reintroduced to the
OL,8,Farea after they disappeared due to
OL,9,Fpersecution more than 200 years ago.
OL,11,FThey have been introduced to Exmoor
OL,12,FNational Park ` which sits across
OL,13,FSomerset and Devon ` to boost the
OL,14,Fpopulation and expand their breeding
OL,15,Frange into south-west England,
OL,16,Fconservationists behind the scheme
OL,17,Fsaid.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785836895
OL,3,CWhite-tailed eagles released in Exmoor
OL,4,Cto boost bird's return to English skies
OL,6,FExmoor was chosen as an additional
OL,7,Flocation for releases after satellite
OL,8,Ftracking showed some of the Isle of
OL,9,FWight birds had frequently visited the
OL,10,Farea ` where historically they would
OL,11,Fhave bred and which provides ideal
OL,12,Fforaging, plenty of fish and breeding
OL,13,Fhabitat along the coastline.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
