PN,30605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785836895
OL,3,CWhite-tailed eagles released in Exmoor
OL,4,Cto boost bird's return to English skies
OL,6,FThe six birds were taken under licence
OL,7,Ffrom the wild in Scotland ` where
OL,8,Fwhite-tailed eagles were successfully
OL,9,Freintroduced some years ago ` and
OL,10,Fbrought south to Exmoor, where they
OL,11,Fhave been cared for by experts while
OL,12,Fbecoming used to their new
OL,13,Fsurroundings.
OL,15,FIt is expected they will travel widely
OL,16,Ffollowing their release before
OL,17,Freturning to the area to breed when
OL,18,Fthey are four or five years old.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
