PN,30606
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785836895
OL,3,CWhite-tailed eagles released in Exmoor
OL,4,Cto boost bird's return to English skies
OL,6,FZoe Smith, from the Roy Dennis
OL,7,FWildlife Foundation, said: "White-
OL,8,Ftailed eagles would have once been a
OL,9,Fcommon natural sight across the south-
OL,10,Fwest of England.
OL,12,F"After so many years absent from this
OL,13,Flandscape it is a special moment to be
OL,14,Freturning them on Exmoor.
OL,16,F"We will closely monitor their
OL,17,Fprogress as they explore and, in time,
OL,18,Fbegin to settle across this region."
OL,26,@oD@\OUtD@AOUxD@AOUzD@dO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/9
