PN,30607
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785836895
OL,3,CWhite-tailed eagles released in Exmoor
OL,4,Cto boost bird's return to English skies
OL,6,FAli Hawkins, senior ecologist with
OL,7,FExmoor National Park Authority, said:
OL,8,F"This is such an exciting moment for
OL,9,FExmoor and a real boost to
OL,10,Fbiodiversity in the national park, as
OL,11,Fwhite-tailed eagles play acrucial
OL,12,Frole in both marine and land-based
OL,13,Fecosystems."
OL,15,FBefore the birds were released, a
OL,16,Fcomprehensive feasibility study and
OL,17,Fpublic surveys were conducted while a
OL,18,Fsteering group made up of local
OL,19,Forganisations and community members is
OL,20,Fhelping guide the project, the team
OL,21,Fsaid.
OL,26,@pD@AOUuD@LO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/9
