PN,30608
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785836895
OL,3,CWhite-tailed eagles released in Exmoor
OL,4,Cto boost bird's return to English skies
OL,6,FUp to 20 more young birds will be
OL,7,Freleased from the Exmoor location over
OL,8,Fthe next three years, while releases
OL,9,Fwill continue from the Isle of Wight.
OL,11,FThe latest release was welcomed by new
OL,12,FEnvironment Secretary Angela Eagle,
OL,13,Fwho said: "Majestic whitetailed
OL,14,Feagles ` a particular favourite of
OL,15,Fmine ` are once again soaring above
OL,16,FExmoor and the Isle of Wight,
OL,17,Freflecting this Government's
OL,18,Fcommitment to reversing the decline of
OL,19,Fnature and protecting it for
OL,20,Fgenerations to come."
OL,26,@uD@KOU|D@UO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/9
